2026-07-03 10:09:40,466 | INFO | Company Object: {'competitor': 'Fitbod', 'source': 'trustpilot', 'review_url': 'https://www.trustpilot.com/review/www.fitbod.me', 'review_count': 15, 'reviews': [{'text': 'I have tried literally everything to cancel this subscription. I downloaded for the free trial and no matter what I do, they keep trying to take money from my account. Worst app Iï¿½ve ever had the misfortune to download. Total scam.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Cancelled subscription to find out months later still geyting charge as you have to cancel google play app as well. Yet another scam.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I issued a ticket through my membership-linked email a week ago on the app asking them about the unsent weekly workout reports and my progress to which they never replied. I believe it is my right as a paying subscriber to have access to all available features.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'It is an okay app, maybe a 3-4 star but they are so tied into the Apple ecosystem that I couldnï¿½t get a refund on day 1 of year 2 because they say Apple controls that. It didnï¿½t quite meet my needs for the money and Iï¿½m out $80 this year.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Diana was very patient and worked hard to help with a difficult issue. She went above and beyond to answer my questions and fix my issues.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Nope. Bought, paid for, app locked saying I havenï¿½t paid. Iï¿½ve contacted support 4 times in the last 4 days. Nada. Waste of money.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'This app automates the task of designing your work out and saves you a lot of time. It automates progression through your own feedback. It tracks your progress and gives you a point system to allow you to see progress across a spectrum of exercises. You can customize which exercises it gives you by telling it what equipment you have. You can ask it to recommend exercises more or less. Thereï¿½s a lot of customization for something that automates workouts for you. Itï¿½s been going great for me.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Good selection of workouts and love how it tracks your progress', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Good app use almost daily', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "I can't say enough bad things about this app. Tough to navigate, slow, and keeps crashing.", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "Worst app i've tried so far. I did the free 7 day trial and the app kept crashing which sucked. Workout order was also all over the place with insane reps and weight. I also noticed an influx of positive reviews here that caught my attention and noticed some of these are written by actual Fitbod employees so be careful and do not trust this scammy businesss! Save your money.", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I tried two other apps they were complicated then I tried Fitbod been using it for three years. It absolutely help change my life when I started. I weighed over 265 pounds now I weigh 216 pounds and I am 17.5% body fat Iï¿½m 52 years old when I first started my weight loss. I weighed 346 pounds Iï¿½m happy to write this review.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Love the app, finally I have managed to stick to the plan over a longer period of time. Iï¿½ve used the app for 6 months and the result is amazing! The reports are so good that I always want to do better next week, and looking forward to see my progress in the upcoming reports. Already recommended the app to plenty of friends.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Brilliant! I got definition in my arms and shoulders within one year. Ideal for parents with small kids who have little time and workout rather at home than in a gym.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Algorithm is not operating correctly. Getting the same exact exercises and cardio which is longer than the whole time allowed. Really falling apart. Iï¿½ve been a top 1% user for 5 years and this is the worst Iï¿½ve seen. And your customer service is totally useless. You are losing customers over the lack of system integrity - and it will soon be me if you donï¿½t get it fixed', 'source': 'trustpilot'}]}
